            </th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <caption>Table 8.11.1
: H Atom Terms Originating from n = 1, 2, and 3</caption>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td class="lt-chem-13449" data-th="Orbital Configuration" style="text-align:center;">1s<sup>1</sup></td>
            <td class="lt-chem-13449" data-th="Term Symbols" style="text-align:center;">\(^2S_{1/2}\)</td>
